WEBVTT

01:37.759 --> 01:40.650
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.470 --> 01:43.630
[Episode 36]

01:45.039 --> 01:45.509
Xin Mei,

01:46.350 --> 01:47.150
is Lu back?

01:47.920 --> 01:48.720
He's not here.

01:49.280 --> 01:50.150
Didn't he go to Chongling Valley

01:50.150 --> 01:51.400
to transform his heart?

01:51.400 --> 01:53.509
Grandmaster didn't return to the Valley.

01:53.509 --> 01:54.070
What?

01:54.430 --> 01:55.229
Lu is missing.

01:55.710 --> 01:56.710
He knocked me out.

01:57.000 --> 01:57.560
After I woke up,

01:57.560 --> 01:59.000
I went to Chongling Valley,

01:59.000 --> 02:00.460
only to find he never went.

02:01.400 --> 02:02.060
Therefore,

02:02.280 --> 02:03.350
out of concern for him,

02:03.350 --> 02:04.610
we came here together.

02:06.200 --> 02:06.800
Landlady.

02:07.590 --> 02:08.520
What month is it?

02:08.680 --> 02:09.560
Why have the flowers outside

02:09.560 --> 02:10.620
suddenly bloomed?

02:11.960 --> 02:12.890
They really did.

02:13.430 --> 02:15.430
We were in a hurry and didn't notice.

02:18.190 --> 02:22.190
A Great Completion Stage cultivator
is dispersing their cultivation.

02:35.520 --> 02:38.250
Cultivators practice
between heaven and earth,

02:38.470 --> 02:40.800
absorbing the essence of the sun and moon.

02:40.910 --> 02:43.910
They contend
with all creation for spiritual energy.

02:44.520 --> 02:46.960
If one day I pass away,

02:47.360 --> 02:49.630
I will disperse my cultivation

02:50.000 --> 02:51.520
and return it to the world.

02:51.680 --> 02:52.810
You're so powerful.

02:52.870 --> 02:53.710
You won't die.

02:55.590 --> 02:57.750
No one can live forever.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.800
Everyone has to die eventually.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.080
When that time comes,

03:01.080 --> 03:02.910
don't cry.

03:03.960 --> 03:04.870
Master!

03:17.820 --> 03:22.650
♪ Spending a lifetime,
I ask myself what I first sought ♪

03:23.829 --> 03:28.590
♪ What is it my heart truly desires? ♪

03:24.280 --> 03:24.910
Senior.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.430
Good.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.430
Great.

03:28.870 --> 03:30.030
Wonderful.

03:29.090 --> 03:32.079
♪ Step by step up the immortal stairway ♪

03:32.500 --> 03:35.250
♪ Paved with countless lost souls ♪

03:33.800 --> 03:34.750
Senior,

03:35.400 --> 03:38.710
I didn't fail your trust.

03:35.530 --> 03:41.480
♪ Who would dare destroy the ladder
to immortality and end the path? ♪

03:39.310 --> 03:40.310
I finally found

03:41.030 --> 03:42.120
your child.

03:41.820 --> 03:46.780
♪ The sun blazes over the earth ♪

03:47.800 --> 03:52.829
♪ Yet it cannot warm
every cold home below ♪

03:52.850 --> 03:56.450
♪ I've heard cries that rend the heavens ♪

03:56.600 --> 03:59.420
♪ I hear the shame of parting ♪

03:59.440 --> 04:02.010
♪ This immortal path admired by all ♪

04:02.030 --> 04:04.910
♪ Can exist, or not exist ♪

04:04.940 --> 04:07.590
♪ Once again I see
the world's cold indifference ♪

04:07.620 --> 04:10.830
♪ Bending what I've cherished
all my life ♪

04:10.980 --> 04:16.740
♪ Illusions and vanity blind the eyes,
how could one still care ♪

04:16.970 --> 04:19.940
♪ So that all may share in ♪

04:19.750 --> 04:20.310
Master!

04:19.970 --> 04:22.840
♪ The road to immortality ♪

04:21.510 --> 04:22.800
Master!

04:22.870 --> 04:28.650
♪ I fear not defying
immortal laws and sacred precepts ♪

04:23.360 --> 04:24.430
Master!

04:25.680 --> 04:27.040
Master!

04:29.450 --> 04:32.350
♪ I'm mocked
for being laughably confused ♪

04:32.510 --> 04:35.180
♪ My solitary voice
will echo through the valley ♪

04:35.370 --> 04:38.280
♪ They speak of immortal grace
and mystic arts ♪

04:38.300 --> 04:41.290
♪ Is there still a trace
of compassion? ♪

04:41.490 --> 04:44.220
♪ Realize my heart
seeks no personal gain ♪

04:44.409 --> 04:47.340
♪ Realize my hands
remain unstained by blood ♪

04:47.370 --> 04:53.360
♪ Realize this life still,
as always, pursues the Dao ♪

04:55.500 --> 04:58.159
♪ Having seen the widespread devastation ♪

04:58.690 --> 05:01.500
♪ How could I look on and ignore it? ♪

05:02.260 --> 05:04.440
♪ I do not fear returning to dust ♪

05:04.520 --> 05:07.890
♪ I walk this path alone ♪

05:07.910 --> 05:10.690
♪ To let all walk ♪

05:10.720 --> 05:13.650
♪ The road to immortality ♪

05:13.790 --> 05:20.330
♪ I fear not defying
immortal laws and sacred precepts ♪

05:20.360 --> 05:23.980
♪ Let sin be punished,
let desire be destroyed ♪

05:24.800 --> 05:31.750
♪ Yet the heart must never be forsaken ♪

05:41.370 --> 05:49.720
[Xin Xie Manor]

05:52.120 --> 05:54.159
Aren't you going back

05:54.159 --> 05:55.240
to your auntie's house in Wei County?

05:55.240 --> 05:56.640
Why haven't you left yet?

05:57.360 --> 05:59.240
But I can't bear to leave you, Master.

05:59.240 --> 05:59.950
And Sheng.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.390
Why can't you?

06:01.390 --> 06:02.920
You'll be back in a few days.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.070
If I'm not here,

06:04.270 --> 06:05.480
who's going to cook for you?

06:05.480 --> 06:06.920
There are restaurants in town.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.510
I'll just take her out to eat.

06:08.510 --> 06:09.800
Any chef

06:09.800 --> 06:11.060
cooks better than you.

06:12.240 --> 06:13.160
But...

06:14.630 --> 06:15.190
But...

06:15.600 --> 06:17.310
Be honest with me.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.310
Are you a bit scared?

06:23.240 --> 06:25.510
It's natural to feel anxious
about going home.

06:25.510 --> 06:27.110
What's there to be afraid of?

06:29.920 --> 06:30.600
Master.

06:31.190 --> 06:32.150
After I left home,

06:32.150 --> 06:33.409
my father passed away.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.690
Not long after,

06:35.270 --> 06:36.800
my mother also passed away.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.310
And later,

06:38.560 --> 06:39.870
the elders of the clan

06:40.190 --> 06:41.850
passed away one after another.

06:41.850 --> 06:44.240
Only I remained unchanged
since I left home.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.390
Sometimes I feel

06:45.750 --> 06:47.150
very close to Wei County,

06:47.600 --> 06:49.060
because it is my hometown.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.720
But at other times,

06:51.190 --> 06:52.950
it feels unfamiliar,

06:53.480 --> 06:55.480
because it is completely different

06:55.750 --> 06:57.159
from the hometown in my memory.

06:57.159 --> 06:58.020
How about this?

06:58.510 --> 06:59.510
You go back first.

06:59.540 --> 07:01.000
If you feel uncomfortable,

07:01.000 --> 07:01.830
just come back.

07:01.830 --> 07:02.750
If someone bullies you,

07:02.750 --> 07:03.430
come back too.

07:03.430 --> 07:05.090
I will always stand up for you.

07:05.160 --> 07:06.420
But you must remember,

07:07.120 --> 07:09.390
Xin Xie Manor will always be your home.

07:10.310 --> 07:11.190
For a person,

07:11.800 --> 07:14.460
having a place to return to
brings peace of mind.

07:15.600 --> 07:16.750
Thank you, Master.

07:23.830 --> 07:24.310
Go now.

07:25.600 --> 07:27.000
Then take good care of yourself.

07:27.000 --> 07:27.680
Go now.

07:30.070 --> 07:30.800
I'm leaving.

07:31.120 --> 07:31.750
Go ahead.

07:35.430 --> 07:36.000
Master,

07:36.600 --> 07:37.510
wait for me to come back.

07:37.510 --> 07:38.170
I will bring you

07:38.170 --> 07:40.170
peach blossom wine. Your favorite .

08:25.040 --> 08:25.510
Here.

08:26.070 --> 08:26.930
Have some soup.

08:28.750 --> 08:29.610
Where are they?

08:30.040 --> 08:31.100
Is everyone there?

08:32.789 --> 08:33.990
They are also eating.

08:34.630 --> 08:35.960
We still have some time.

08:48.320 --> 08:49.270
Actually, I had long known

08:49.270 --> 08:51.440
that my master's life
was coming to an end.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.570
This time, I came out

08:53.390 --> 08:54.750
to find the Immortality Pill

08:54.750 --> 08:55.880
to prolong his life.

08:56.870 --> 08:57.930
But I didn't expect

08:58.630 --> 09:01.270
that not only did I fail
to bring back the Immortality Pill,

09:01.270 --> 09:02.390
but I couldn't even see him

09:02.390 --> 09:03.190
one last time.

09:04.600 --> 09:05.460
It was my fault.

09:06.440 --> 09:09.100
I should have returned
to Xin Xie Manor earlier.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.780
It was all my fault.

09:12.270 --> 09:12.750
If I hadn't

09:12.750 --> 09:14.010
forced your marriage,

09:15.440 --> 09:16.230
it wouldn't have ended up

09:16.230 --> 09:16.960
like this.

09:20.790 --> 09:22.650
This matter cannot end like this.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.480
I will kill Li Mofu

09:25.440 --> 09:26.570
to avenge my master.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.320
I also want everyone in Tianyuan Sect

09:29.320 --> 09:30.840
involved in this matter

09:32.080 --> 09:33.840
to be held accountable.

09:35.870 --> 09:36.390
Okay.

09:37.360 --> 09:38.620
They definitely will.

09:50.270 --> 09:52.130
After the battle at Sihe Library,

09:52.220 --> 09:52.840
we fell into the hands

09:52.840 --> 09:53.890
of Qinghong Sect.

09:55.000 --> 09:55.440
They

09:55.440 --> 09:57.040
could have just captured us,

09:57.600 --> 09:58.200
but instead

09:58.200 --> 10:00.030
they've been trying to deceive me.

10:00.030 --> 10:01.090
It was just to get me

10:01.320 --> 10:02.510
to help them translate

10:02.510 --> 10:04.750
the ancient book
written in War Demon script.

10:04.750 --> 10:07.010
Is there something wrong with this book?

10:08.440 --> 10:08.960
Look.

10:15.910 --> 10:16.370
This...

10:16.790 --> 10:18.320
This is Wusheng Formation!

10:18.400 --> 10:20.390
Back then, the War Demons
used this formation

10:20.390 --> 10:21.750
to open the heavenly ladder.

10:21.750 --> 10:22.550
That's right.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.030
Wusheng Formation means

10:24.030 --> 10:25.510
creating existence from nothing.

10:25.510 --> 10:27.510
This formation uses human vitality

10:27.670 --> 10:29.440
to stimulate the growth of plants.

10:29.440 --> 10:30.770
A strand of hair just now

10:30.840 --> 10:32.510
was enough to promote its growth.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.440
But for a massive spiritual plant

10:33.440 --> 10:34.640
like the Jianmu Tree,

10:34.720 --> 10:35.440
it requires the sacrifice

10:35.440 --> 10:36.500
of more human lives

10:36.670 --> 10:38.070
to stimulate its growth.

10:41.030 --> 10:41.830
Grandmaster,

10:42.390 --> 10:43.600
the book you translated back then

10:43.600 --> 10:45.000
also had this formation?

10:46.120 --> 10:46.960
At that time,

10:47.270 --> 10:48.840
he dispersed the parts of the text

10:48.840 --> 10:50.480
related to the formation

10:50.840 --> 10:53.080
and hid them
in other sections of the book.

10:53.080 --> 10:53.750
It was only afterwards,

10:53.750 --> 10:54.620
when I recalled many

10:54.620 --> 10:55.790
inconsistent parts,

10:55.790 --> 10:57.050
that I vaguely guessed

10:57.360 --> 10:58.820
he wanted this formation.

10:59.240 --> 11:00.440
I have also been wondering

11:00.440 --> 11:01.690
who exactly is behind

11:02.030 --> 11:02.910
Qinghong Sect.

11:03.870 --> 11:04.870
Later, I inferred

11:05.080 --> 11:06.270
that after we came back,

11:06.270 --> 11:08.000
the first immortal sect to cause trouble

11:08.000 --> 11:10.260
was likely the mastermind behind it all.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.450
So you knocked me out

11:12.600 --> 11:13.240
to find out

11:13.240 --> 11:14.570
the person behind them?

11:16.000 --> 11:17.130
It's Tianyuan Sect.

11:18.360 --> 11:19.630
After I went up the mountain,

11:19.630 --> 11:21.490
I found Bai Zongying imprisoned.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.450
Through him,

11:23.360 --> 11:24.390
I found the truth.

11:53.720 --> 11:55.850
They also want to grow the Jianmu Tree?

11:56.960 --> 11:59.270
Back then,
when the War Demons grew the Jianmu Tree,

11:59.270 --> 12:00.480
if it weren't for
the Twelve Immortal Sects

12:00.480 --> 12:02.100
and the High Priest of Youhu Clan

12:02.100 --> 12:03.390
joining forces to suppress it,

12:03.390 --> 12:04.590
I'm afraid this world

12:04.630 --> 12:07.510
would have already been plunged
into misery and suffering.

12:07.510 --> 12:08.770
How dare Tianyuan Sect

12:08.840 --> 12:10.720
risk universal condemnation

12:11.150 --> 12:12.270
and do such a thing?

12:13.240 --> 12:14.640
Well, they did it anyway.

12:14.750 --> 12:16.080
What can you do about it?

12:16.480 --> 12:17.540
I used the Sunblock

12:17.750 --> 12:20.150
to deal a heavy blow
to the Jianmu Tree seed.

12:20.320 --> 12:20.840
But I still couldn't

12:20.840 --> 12:22.170
completely destroy it.

12:22.550 --> 12:23.150
Next,

12:23.750 --> 12:25.680
they will definitely take action.

12:25.870 --> 12:26.370
We...

12:30.150 --> 12:30.750
Qianqiao,

12:30.790 --> 12:31.590
what's wrong?

12:31.840 --> 12:32.440
Qianqiao!

12:33.320 --> 12:34.720
Qianqiao, what's wrong?

12:34.870 --> 12:35.460
What's going on?

12:35.460 --> 12:36.190
Lu Qianqiao!

12:36.550 --> 12:37.280
Lu Qianqiao!

12:37.320 --> 12:37.920
Qianqiao!

12:38.870 --> 12:39.470
Qianqiao!

12:43.550 --> 12:45.360
Why sigh over

12:45.550 --> 12:47.120
what you have never had?

12:48.270 --> 12:52.320
Like an illusion,
a dream wakes to emptiness.

12:53.270 --> 12:56.510
By the misty river, the music rises.

12:57.320 --> 13:01.870
I only regret
that we may never meet again.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.200
Young sir,

13:08.200 --> 13:09.790
where are you heading?

13:10.510 --> 13:11.310
Lanshui Town.

13:12.030 --> 13:12.960
Lanshui Town?

13:13.550 --> 13:15.210
Lanshui Town in Xiangzhou...

13:15.910 --> 13:16.790
is my hometown.

13:20.790 --> 13:22.390
Old sir, why are you laughing?

13:22.390 --> 13:24.050
You say that is your hometown,

13:24.360 --> 13:26.420
but you can't even get the name right.

13:27.120 --> 13:29.200
It used to be called Lanshui Town.

13:29.790 --> 13:31.590
But later, in a provincial exam,

13:31.870 --> 13:34.000
3 scholars from that place
passed in a single year,

13:34.000 --> 13:35.630
so it was renamed Sanyuan Town.

13:35.630 --> 13:36.890
It has been many years.

13:37.270 --> 13:39.870
You haven't been home for a long time,
have you?

13:40.080 --> 13:41.940
Indeed, it has been quite a while.

13:41.950 --> 13:44.880
So this time
you are going home to visit your parents?

13:46.270 --> 13:47.930
My parents passed away early.

13:48.200 --> 13:49.330
As for my relatives,

13:49.390 --> 13:51.240
I haven't contacted them for a long time.

13:51.240 --> 13:52.870
I don't know if they are still alive.

13:52.870 --> 13:55.030
You don't know the name of your hometown,

13:55.030 --> 13:57.270
nor whether your relatives
are still alive.

13:57.270 --> 13:59.470
If your parents and relatives are gone,

13:59.960 --> 14:00.760
can that place

14:00.840 --> 14:02.840
still be considered your hometown?

14:03.000 --> 14:04.510
Why are you going back?

14:05.670 --> 14:06.930
Then where do you think

14:07.550 --> 14:08.630
I should go?

14:10.150 --> 14:11.950
The path you came from is unseen,

14:12.320 --> 14:14.450
and the final destination is unknown.

14:15.200 --> 14:18.480
Worldly affairs are ever unpredictable,
coldly passing by.

14:18.480 --> 14:21.670
Who cares about rise and fall?

14:22.390 --> 14:24.000
Walk your own path.

14:24.440 --> 14:26.100
Go to your final destination.

14:26.790 --> 14:28.320
Walk your own path.

14:29.390 --> 14:31.240
Go to your final destination.

14:41.520 --> 14:44.270
[Jin Lun's spiritual sea]

15:02.960 --> 15:03.960
Dozing off again.

15:04.320 --> 15:05.730
I've been calling you for ages.

15:05.730 --> 15:07.080
What sweet dream did you have?

15:07.080 --> 15:07.600
I...

15:07.790 --> 15:09.080
I dreamed that

15:09.480 --> 15:12.080
I went to a very mysterious place.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.010
Where did you go?

15:15.000 --> 15:16.230
Where?

15:16.510 --> 15:17.790
Where did I go?

15:18.360 --> 15:19.150
Where did I go?

15:19.150 --> 15:19.960
Where do I go?

15:21.240 --> 15:22.080
Where do I go?

15:22.840 --> 15:24.510
Your parents just passed away.

15:24.510 --> 15:25.970
Where are you going again?

15:26.270 --> 15:27.670
What are your plans next?

15:28.080 --> 15:28.550
You can't

15:28.550 --> 15:30.150
keep following me like this.

15:30.360 --> 15:32.290
Don't you have things you want to do

15:32.390 --> 15:33.720
or places you want to go?

15:57.240 --> 15:58.550
Where is your final

15:59.390 --> 16:01.150
destination?

16:22.000 --> 16:22.750
Master?

16:27.440 --> 16:30.440
You never joined the sect,
so why call me Master?

16:33.390 --> 16:34.390
Let me ask you,

16:35.150 --> 16:38.150
you lingered at the foot of the mountain
for a long time that day

16:38.150 --> 16:40.270
but ultimately didn't come up.

16:41.510 --> 16:42.790
Why was that?

16:44.790 --> 16:46.320
My desires were too strong,

16:46.600 --> 16:48.200
and lust had blinded my eyes.

16:48.550 --> 16:50.210
I could not see the path ahead.

16:50.840 --> 16:51.910
You think

16:52.630 --> 16:54.200
what really stopped you

16:54.680 --> 16:55.710
was lust?

16:56.320 --> 16:57.980
Please enlighten me, Master.

16:59.440 --> 17:01.200
All dharmas are without self.

17:01.390 --> 17:03.190
All things return to stillness.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.349
What is emptiness?

17:06.160 --> 17:07.420
No words, no thoughts.

17:08.030 --> 17:09.359
No abiding, no affairs.

17:09.829 --> 17:10.760
Nothing to gain.

17:11.550 --> 17:13.079
No contention, no display.

17:13.160 --> 17:14.359
The wise do not argue.

17:14.510 --> 17:16.349
When the mouth opens, spirit scatters;

17:16.349 --> 17:18.510
when the tongue moves, disputes arise.

17:18.510 --> 17:19.569
This is "no words."

17:20.310 --> 17:21.569
When a pure mind stirs,

17:22.099 --> 17:24.400
the five poisons
and seven emotions extinguish.

17:24.400 --> 17:26.829
Evil thoughts and delusions
do not enter the mind.

17:26.829 --> 17:28.089
This is "no thoughts."

17:28.240 --> 17:29.310
Good.

17:30.270 --> 17:31.110
Go on.

17:32.150 --> 17:33.680
The mind does not cling to forms.

17:33.680 --> 17:35.010
Do not dwell on the past.

17:35.160 --> 17:36.110
Past and future—

17:36.680 --> 17:37.610
do not go or stay.

17:38.480 --> 17:39.680
This is "no abiding."

17:40.160 --> 17:41.350
As for "no affairs"—

17:42.790 --> 17:44.750
the mind is inherently pure and unstained.

17:44.750 --> 17:46.920
It is only ordinary people
who bind themselves.

17:46.920 --> 17:48.520
If my mind is like a calm lake,

17:49.200 --> 17:51.260
then all things are easily resolved.

17:52.310 --> 17:54.170
And what about "Nothing to gain?"

17:54.440 --> 17:55.440
All living beings

17:55.960 --> 17:57.510
and all things are but dust
before the eyes.

17:57.510 --> 17:58.840
The mind seeks nothing,

17:59.440 --> 18:01.480
so naturally there is nothing to gain.

18:01.480 --> 18:03.960
But you were born with everything.

18:04.510 --> 18:05.750
Family ties,

18:06.110 --> 18:07.720
wealth, background,

18:08.110 --> 18:09.000
and this

18:09.590 --> 18:11.590
golden ring on your arm.

18:15.790 --> 18:17.790
That woman is not your tribulation,

18:18.000 --> 18:20.440
but a sharp blade

18:20.460 --> 18:22.880
that cuts through the mists
of your delusion.

18:22.880 --> 18:23.440
Master,

18:24.480 --> 18:25.610
I don't understand.

18:27.640 --> 18:28.440
People

18:28.750 --> 18:30.830
come into this world naked,

18:31.370 --> 18:33.610
walk through it,

18:33.960 --> 18:37.000
and eventually leave naked too.

18:37.400 --> 18:40.000
The final destination of all things

18:40.830 --> 18:42.640
is a single word—nothing.

18:43.270 --> 18:44.960
That is the freedom

18:45.510 --> 18:48.170
of an infinite existence
beyond life and death,

18:48.350 --> 18:50.830
transcending time and space.

18:51.750 --> 18:53.070
But since you were born

18:53.120 --> 18:55.180
with a lotus flower on your forehead,

18:55.310 --> 18:57.040
carrying a profound treasure,

18:57.110 --> 18:59.570
how can you
walk lightly through this world?

19:02.880 --> 19:04.000
Jin Lun,

19:04.310 --> 19:07.070
you have been deeply mired for decades.

19:07.590 --> 19:09.640
You still haven't figured out

19:09.670 --> 19:11.020
which path to take?

19:11.960 --> 19:13.830
Think carefully.

19:14.880 --> 19:16.480
Where does your true

19:17.440 --> 19:19.750
destination lie?

20:02.510 --> 20:03.110
Jin Lun.

20:06.750 --> 20:07.400
Do you know

20:07.400 --> 20:08.530
where you're going?

20:15.880 --> 20:17.340
Have you made up your mind?

20:18.030 --> 20:19.160
Where you are going,

20:19.750 --> 20:20.480
I will not be.

20:23.440 --> 20:25.000
I used to see you as a puzzle

20:26.240 --> 20:27.500
that I wanted to solve.

20:28.550 --> 20:29.750
But the deeper I went,

20:30.530 --> 20:32.530
the harder it was to control myself.

20:33.750 --> 20:34.240
Sheng,

20:35.550 --> 20:37.010
I once truly cared for you.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.350
I won't deny that.

20:42.870 --> 20:43.870
But I've let it go.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.980
No words, no thoughts.

20:48.790 --> 20:50.120
No abiding, no affairs.

20:50.550 --> 20:51.480
Nothing to gain.

20:54.000 --> 20:55.860
You shouldn't be my tribulation,

20:57.070 --> 20:58.730
nor the shackles that trap me.

21:01.680 --> 21:03.480
The only thing truly trapping me

21:05.510 --> 21:06.510
is myself.

21:13.230 --> 21:14.160
What did you see?

21:17.200 --> 21:17.640
Me.

21:18.480 --> 21:19.400
A naked me,

21:20.350 --> 21:21.550
with no attachments.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.640
So where are you heading?

21:24.110 --> 21:25.030
My heart has no desires.

21:24.190 --> 21:28.130
♪ Honor and disgrace;
rumors and prejudice ♪

21:25.680 --> 21:26.540
I am emptiness.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.160
Wherever I am needed,

21:28.680 --> 21:29.480
that's where I'll be.

21:28.920 --> 21:32.320
♪ Everyone has their own take ♪

21:32.960 --> 21:36.780
♪ Fingers coated in blood
and disasters brought about ♪

21:34.880 --> 21:35.750
I have nothing,

21:36.400 --> 21:37.450
yet I have everything.

21:36.810 --> 21:40.040
♪ Were never what I wanted ♪

21:38.830 --> 21:39.750
From now on,

21:40.330 --> 21:44.170
♪ The great way is fading away,
besieged by mysterious traps ♪

21:40.340 --> 21:41.420
in this vast world,

21:42.110 --> 21:43.000
nothing can

21:43.000 --> 21:44.530
stop my footsteps anymore.

21:45.040 --> 21:48.790
♪ Who dares to treat life and death
as nothing? ♪

21:48.820 --> 21:52.540
♪ In the blink of an eye, the body
collapses, and the soul is destroyed ♪

21:52.560 --> 21:57.540
♪ The fire starts raging across the land ♪

21:58.310 --> 22:00.350
♪ What do you think is ♪

22:00.380 --> 22:02.660
♪ The most impressive farewell
in the world? ♪

22:03.030 --> 22:06.160
♪ The endless slaughter and massacres ♪

22:07.000 --> 22:10.950
♪ Do not wait until that thin snow
on the eaves ♪

22:10.980 --> 22:14.200
♪ Turns a young man's hair white
before you regret it ♪

22:14.760 --> 22:16.500
♪ When do you think ♪

22:16.520 --> 22:18.950
♪ The bloody strife will come to an end? ♪

22:18.980 --> 22:22.300
♪ Burn myself to prove it
without looking back ♪

22:22.850 --> 22:26.820
♪ Holding the morning glow in hand,
I paint the world ♪

22:26.850 --> 22:33.030
♪ The dawn light
illuminates the vast sky ♪

22:58.960 --> 23:00.510
Senior Brother Bai ran away?

23:00.510 --> 23:01.680
They couldn't have gone far.

23:01.680 --> 23:02.640
I'll take some men down the mountain

23:02.640 --> 23:03.550
and bring them back.

23:03.550 --> 23:04.480
There's no need.

23:05.750 --> 23:06.750
It is destiny.

23:08.920 --> 23:10.550
Let us just go with the flow.

23:13.510 --> 23:14.840
You're coughing again?

23:18.030 --> 23:19.290
Have some water first.

23:27.790 --> 23:29.050
Prepare brush and ink.

23:29.750 --> 23:30.830
What for?

23:33.830 --> 23:35.790
I'll write to the senior uncles

23:36.510 --> 23:37.920
and elders of every immortal sect.

23:37.920 --> 23:38.720
Write to them?

23:39.680 --> 23:41.160
I'm going to expose this.

23:42.160 --> 23:43.760
Master is acting willfully,

23:44.270 --> 23:46.480
disregarding all living beings
in the world.

23:46.480 --> 23:47.640
The only plan now

23:49.540 --> 23:51.840
is to gather the strength
of all immortal sects

23:51.840 --> 23:53.050
to stop him.

23:56.960 --> 23:58.960
Esteemed senior uncles and elders,

23:59.880 --> 24:01.940
Li Mofu, the leader of Tianyuan Sect,

24:02.790 --> 24:05.450
intends to use dark arts
to grow the Jianmu Tree,

24:05.750 --> 24:07.400
climb the heavenly ladder once again,

24:07.400 --> 24:09.060
and reopen the Heavenly Gate.

24:10.030 --> 24:12.510
He views all living beings as ants;

24:13.070 --> 24:14.790
his arrogance is extreme.

24:16.350 --> 24:18.110
The tragic Battle of Pinghu

24:19.070 --> 24:21.470
is something we dare not forget
even today.

24:21.790 --> 24:23.450
If the Jianmu Tree is revived,

24:23.680 --> 24:25.720
the world will face devastation

24:26.070 --> 24:27.400
and endless suffering.

24:28.510 --> 24:30.570
I hope you will all lend a helping hand

24:31.440 --> 24:33.480
to save the people from this crisis.

24:34.030 --> 24:35.490
I sincerely plead with you

24:35.880 --> 24:37.680
and await your favorable reply.

24:38.350 --> 24:39.310
Tianyuan Sect,

24:40.350 --> 24:41.310
Bai Zongying.

26:14.830 --> 26:15.630
You're awake?

26:17.110 --> 26:18.200
Dr. Zhu Yu said

26:18.720 --> 26:20.830
that you used the Sunblock for too long

26:20.830 --> 26:22.720
and absorbed too much
of its reversing power,

26:22.720 --> 26:24.590
which your body couldn't handle,

26:25.070 --> 26:26.330
causing the backlash.

26:26.960 --> 26:28.510
Your heart meridian is damaged.

26:28.510 --> 26:30.570
You must recover as soon as possible.

26:32.470 --> 26:33.400
What should I do?

26:35.110 --> 26:36.830
Prepare for the heart transformation
immediately

26:36.830 --> 26:39.230
and become an ordinary person completely.

26:41.270 --> 26:42.600
Isn't this a good thing?

26:43.200 --> 26:44.000
The heart transformation was originally

26:44.000 --> 26:44.960
in your plan.

26:45.540 --> 26:46.870
And Zhu Yu and the others

26:46.960 --> 26:48.620
are already preparing for it.

26:49.310 --> 26:50.350
After this heart transformation,

26:50.350 --> 26:52.080
you will be free from the curse.

26:52.790 --> 26:54.050
We can live a good life.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.030
Qianqiao,

26:58.830 --> 26:59.640
don't worry.

27:00.880 --> 27:02.240
What you should care about most right now

27:02.240 --> 27:03.030
is yourself.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.660
I don't want you to take risks,

27:05.830 --> 27:07.200
nor do I want you to abandon

27:07.200 --> 27:08.480
your long-held wish

27:09.400 --> 27:10.550
for some so-called sense of righteous duty

27:10.550 --> 27:11.550
to save the world.

27:12.400 --> 27:13.510
I am very stubborn.

27:14.400 --> 27:16.000
I just want the people I like

27:16.160 --> 27:16.970
and care about

27:17.750 --> 27:18.880
to be safe,

27:19.640 --> 27:20.970
healthy, and live long.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.720
So you must get better.

27:27.510 --> 27:28.160
I will.

28:08.790 --> 28:10.350
You've been waiting for him all day.

28:10.350 --> 28:11.030
Leave now.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.810
He won't come to see you.

28:14.110 --> 28:15.770
I have something to say to him.

28:16.230 --> 28:17.100
Tell me then.

28:17.680 --> 28:18.640
I will pass on

28:18.640 --> 28:19.970
your exact words to him.

28:27.200 --> 28:28.730
What do you want to tell him?

28:30.160 --> 28:30.750
No need.

28:31.350 --> 28:32.640
Everything I want to say

28:32.640 --> 28:33.830
is in this box.

28:52.110 --> 28:52.590
Senior.

28:54.070 --> 28:55.800
Is she still refusing to leave?

28:55.830 --> 28:57.560
She asked me to give this to you.

29:24.350 --> 29:26.310
This is her life-binding Gu.

29:27.110 --> 29:29.030
She entrusted her life to you.

29:29.830 --> 29:31.750
Whether she lives or dies

29:33.030 --> 29:35.640
is entirely up to you.

29:52.480 --> 29:53.550
He accepted it.

29:55.640 --> 29:57.480
But now he has attained enlightenment

29:57.480 --> 29:59.070
and taken the Path of Detachment,

29:59.070 --> 30:00.680
distancing himself from worldly affairs.

30:00.680 --> 30:01.920
He asked me to tell you...

30:01.920 --> 30:02.830
All the past,

30:03.440 --> 30:05.100
though still vivid in my mind,

30:05.920 --> 30:07.180
feels like an illusion

30:07.920 --> 30:09.720
when seen with a peaceful heart.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.560
Love and hate leave no trace.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.940
The past is like smoke,

30:14.750 --> 30:16.010
dissipating entirely

30:16.680 --> 30:17.920
in the wind.

30:24.110 --> 30:25.200
Your bond is over.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.680
You should go now.

30:30.100 --> 30:30.700
Oh, right.

30:31.440 --> 30:32.830
He said the celestial signs are unusual.

30:32.830 --> 30:34.490
There will be a storm tonight.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.940
He asked me to give you this umbrella.

30:45.590 --> 30:46.190
Thank you.

31:41.680 --> 31:42.240
Get lost!

31:42.880 --> 31:43.440
Get lost!

31:50.400 --> 31:50.930
Get lost!

31:51.270 --> 31:51.750
Move!

31:55.790 --> 31:56.310
Move!

31:56.830 --> 31:58.400
Get out of my body!

32:28.830 --> 32:30.000
Sheng,

32:30.480 --> 32:32.550
you can't resist me.

32:32.720 --> 32:33.550
Get out!

32:33.880 --> 32:35.440
Get out of my body!

32:35.960 --> 32:37.110
I am your father.

32:38.070 --> 32:40.070
I gave you your life.

32:40.720 --> 32:41.400
Today,

32:42.000 --> 32:44.480
dedicate your flesh and blood to me,

32:48.070 --> 32:49.830
and help my soul rest here

32:50.480 --> 32:52.030
so I can be reborn.

33:35.950 --> 33:43.910
[Rainwatch Terrace]

33:55.960 --> 33:56.440
Father.

33:58.110 --> 33:59.640
Did you receive the letter?

34:01.750 --> 34:02.510
Bai Zongying

34:03.240 --> 34:04.960
would risk the prestige of Tianyuan Sect

34:04.960 --> 34:05.960
to expose Li Mofu.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.750
This cannot be false.

34:21.280 --> 34:23.210
Once the heavenly ladder is built,

34:23.760 --> 34:25.760
disaster will descend upon the world.

34:25.760 --> 34:26.620
The human realm

34:27.190 --> 34:29.989
will surely be plunged
into misery and suffering.

34:30.400 --> 34:32.030
I will take people
to Tianyuan Mountain now

34:32.030 --> 34:33.290
to meet up with Junior.

34:34.030 --> 34:34.670
Wait.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.730
This battle will be dangerous,

34:41.800 --> 34:43.400
and the future is uncertain.

34:44.110 --> 34:44.570
Father.

34:45.550 --> 34:47.320
This battle concerns the common people.

34:47.320 --> 34:49.510
As the Young Sect Master
of Lingji Mountain,

34:49.510 --> 34:50.320
it's my duty.

34:59.480 --> 35:01.880
I haven't let you unsheathe
for many years.

35:03.800 --> 35:04.930
Set off immediately

35:05.310 --> 35:07.180
and march to Tianyuan Mountain.

35:07.670 --> 35:08.150
Yes.

35:15.480 --> 35:16.540
Senior Xia Xuanzi,

35:16.960 --> 35:19.020
our Sect Leader would like to see you.

35:20.760 --> 35:21.490
Lead the way.

36:19.400 --> 36:21.110
I've long heard that you

36:21.510 --> 36:22.640
are good at using Gu.

36:23.150 --> 36:24.680
How did you end up like this?

36:26.230 --> 36:27.840
I let my guard down for a moment

36:27.840 --> 36:30.640
and was set up,
and my physical body was destroyed.

36:30.640 --> 36:32.550
My primordial spirit
can only temporarily reside

36:32.550 --> 36:34.000
in this body.

36:34.710 --> 36:35.800
When I destroy

36:35.800 --> 36:37.480
the soul of this body,

36:37.710 --> 36:39.670
I will fully take control of it

36:40.230 --> 36:41.960
and return to my peak.

36:42.440 --> 36:44.230
This is your daughter.

36:45.280 --> 36:46.800
You are really heartless.

36:47.070 --> 36:48.930
If we talk about being heartless,

36:49.070 --> 36:50.710
I can't compare to you.

36:51.440 --> 36:53.300
As the head of all immortal sects,

36:53.510 --> 36:55.510
behind the scenes, you actually...

36:56.920 --> 36:57.760
Go on.

36:58.710 --> 36:59.480
I've been hiding in

36:59.480 --> 37:01.070
Sheng's spiritual sea,

37:01.690 --> 37:03.750
fighting her for control of her body.

37:04.150 --> 37:05.550
Back then in North Xiang,

37:05.960 --> 37:06.800
I briefly

37:06.800 --> 37:08.190
woke up for a short time

37:08.670 --> 37:10.110
and learned about the whole story

37:10.110 --> 37:11.110
of Qinghong Sect.

37:11.890 --> 37:13.820
As for the immortal sect behind it,

37:14.320 --> 37:15.980
I didn't think of anyone else.

37:17.110 --> 37:18.280
Seeing you today,

37:18.670 --> 37:20.670
my guess was indeed correct.

37:31.840 --> 37:32.710
Sect Leader Li,

37:33.340 --> 37:35.340
I came with sincerity.

37:36.150 --> 37:38.550
Are you still
not going to tell me the truth?

37:41.920 --> 37:44.050
The people of the Wushuang Society say

37:44.320 --> 37:45.880
that the collapse of the heavenly ladder

37:45.880 --> 37:47.480
and the departure of the gods

37:47.480 --> 37:49.630
are the greatest mercy of the divine race.

37:49.630 --> 37:51.510
But although it's mercy to mortals,

37:51.510 --> 37:53.170
it's an outright abandonment

37:53.320 --> 37:54.920
of us immortal sect members.

37:55.840 --> 37:57.770
They cut off the path to Ascension,

37:57.800 --> 37:59.000
intending to trap the immortal sect

37:59.000 --> 38:00.600
in the mortal world forever.

38:01.360 --> 38:02.420
Fellow Taoist Xia,

38:03.320 --> 38:04.580
you are an expert in Gu.

38:05.590 --> 38:07.480
You should know what happens

38:07.630 --> 38:09.280
when a group of bugs is placed

38:09.760 --> 38:10.760
in a sealed jar.

38:11.760 --> 38:14.090
This is a massacre for the immortal sects.

38:14.510 --> 38:16.960
We absolutely cannot just sit
and wait for death.

38:16.960 --> 38:18.020
Fellow Taoist Xia,

38:18.070 --> 38:19.470
are you willing to join me

38:20.280 --> 38:21.810
to reopen the Heavenly Gate

38:21.960 --> 38:23.400
and ascend to godhood?

38:25.800 --> 38:27.000
What do you want to do?

38:27.550 --> 38:28.800
Grow the Jianmu Tree

38:29.280 --> 38:30.940
and reopen the Heavenly Gate.

38:33.110 --> 38:34.800
What a lunatic.

38:50.480 --> 38:51.230
However,

38:52.230 --> 38:53.360
I like it.

38:57.320 --> 38:57.840
Good.

38:58.320 --> 38:59.360
There are truly too few

38:59.360 --> 39:00.800
intelligent people in this world.

39:00.800 --> 39:02.550
Most are hypocritical and foolish,

39:02.550 --> 39:03.810
unfit for great tasks.

39:04.400 --> 39:05.440
Fellow Taoist Xia,

39:05.440 --> 39:06.550
you have both ambition

39:06.550 --> 39:07.280
and ability.

39:07.710 --> 39:09.110
You're similar to me.

39:09.630 --> 39:11.160
This is a path of bloodshed.

39:11.510 --> 39:12.360
I hope

39:12.630 --> 39:14.830
someone can fight their way out with me.

39:19.670 --> 39:20.730
Fellow Taoist Xia,

39:21.360 --> 39:22.820
are you willing to join me?

39:27.710 --> 39:29.440
Why not?

40:18.320 --> 40:19.670
I'm late. I'm late.

40:22.670 --> 40:23.510
Sect Master Lin,

40:23.510 --> 40:24.570
please forgive me.

40:25.210 --> 40:26.270
Hasn't Lingxu Sect

40:26.280 --> 40:27.760
always been Tianyuan Sect's

40:27.760 --> 40:28.710
lackey?

40:30.480 --> 40:32.670
Why are you here today?

40:33.320 --> 40:35.110
I do want immortality,

40:35.360 --> 40:37.320
but I disdain using such methods

40:37.550 --> 40:39.080
in exchange for my own life.

40:39.360 --> 40:40.840
If I were to defy the natural order,

40:40.840 --> 40:43.640
I wouldn't be able to face our founders
after I die.

40:43.920 --> 40:45.250
That sounds easy to say.

40:45.620 --> 40:47.880
I'm afraid that
if the Jianmu Tree spell is activated,

40:47.880 --> 40:49.010
given your bad luck,

40:49.400 --> 40:50.280
you might die.

40:52.090 --> 40:52.570
You...

41:11.070 --> 41:11.880
Miss Xin,

41:12.440 --> 41:13.640
we are about to begin.

41:14.150 --> 41:15.550
You may excuse yourself.

41:23.230 --> 41:23.920
Don't worry.
